# Results

Updated 2026-10-23 02:02 UTC. All numbers are PAPER (simulated fills against live books; no fantasy fills: takers only eat resting size, makers only fill on prints through / at the price after queue, or on adverse crossings). Positive pnl here is necessary, not sufficient.

